# Keep the book's ENDING and continuity notes off any public deploy.
# Only reader.html + app/ + manuscript/ should ever be served.
#
# app/ MUST NOT be listed here. It is the application itself; excluding it makes
# every module 404 in production and the site shows a blank page.
.claude/
state/
.github/
feedback/
# archive/ was NOT listed here until 2026-08-08 and was being served publicly:
# 1.4MB of story bibles, outlines and the complete pre-revision manuscript,
# ending included. Exactly what the two lines above exist to prevent.
archive/
# scratchpad/ holds working documents — editorial reports, briefs, analyses.
# They quote the ending freely and name every unresolved defect in the book.
# Added 2026-08-12, when an editorial report was committed here and would have
# been served: the same failure as archive/ above, two lines further down.
scratchpad/
# The Playwright harness and its fixtures. Never deployed; kept out of the repo
# root so Vercel's framework detection is not triggered by a package.json.
test/
